# The exit hint on the /help catalog's row: a first Ctrl-C leaves the catalog
# up and replaces its key help with the warning; the key help comes back with
# the window.
wait 2
type /help
key Enter
wait 1
snap help-open
key C-c
# The exit hint is snapped while it is up and once its 3 s are over, each
# by the screen rather than by a second count against them (FLAKE-HINT4).
until shown press ctrl+c again to exit
wait 0.5
snap help-cc
wait 3.5
until gone press ctrl+c again to exit
snap help-cc-expired
